  "confidence": 0.95,
  "solution": "VR eye buffer allocation failure due to insufficient GPU memory. Solution: 1) Open Project Settings \u2192 Rendering 2) Set VR Pixel Density to 0.8 or lower 3) Disable Mobile HDR 4) Set Mobile MSAA to \"No MSAA\" 5) Reduce texture quality settings 6) Test with simplified materials",
  "metadata": {
    "severity": "critical",
    "platform": "quest",
    "category": "memory"
  }
}

